### Login request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password"
}

### Tokens request
POST {{baseUrl}}/oauth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "grant_type": "password",
    "client_id": "0198861c-bcec-7322-8e35-c64f64913de5",
    "client_secret": "G0r9EWnALDLXW6HGcnfJCX75EWDzHQUf0v7BuXpS",
    "username": "testuser",
    "password": "password",
    "scope": "*"
}

### GET authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/user
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Refresh tokens request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "refreshToken": ""
}

